@startuml
title Farm Management System State Diagram

[*] --> LoggedOut

state LoggedOut
state LoggedIn
state "Market Conditions" as MarketConditions
state "Pest Control Help" as PestControlHelp
state "Soil Suggestions" as SoilSuggestions
state "Weather Insights" as WeatherInsights
state "Labour Availability" as LabourAvailability
state SessionEnded <<final>>

LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : User Login / Authentication Successful

LoggedIn --> MarketConditions : Select Market Conditions / Display Report
LoggedIn --> PestControlHelp : Select Pest Control Help / Request Photo
LoggedIn --> SoilSuggestions : Provide Soil Information / Suggest Crops
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : Provide Location / Show Insights
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : Provide Location / Show Details

MarketConditions --> LoggedIn : Continue / View Results
PestControlHelp --> LoggedIn : Continue / View Techniques
SoilSuggestions --> LoggedIn : Continue / Review Suggestions
WeatherInsights --> LoggedIn : Continue / Review Insights
LabourAvailability --> LoggedIn : Continue / Review Availability

LoggedIn --> SessionEnded : User Logout / End Session

@enduml
